<decision #track.harden-ai-workflow-agent-runtime.failure-terminal {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  durable_candidate = true
}
(
  <question ?>Provider completion 失败时 delegate 应以何种终态返回？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>失败必须失败，不能 completed 后返回空字符串。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Provider failure SHALL terminate the delegate and parent workflow tool as structured failure。</?>
    <rationale ?>terminal state 是控制面 authority，不能与 effect evidence 矛盾。</?>
    <evidence ?>事故 session 与 AiAgentExecutor provider_failed 分支。</?>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.harden-ai-workflow-agent-runtime.result-authority {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  durable_candidate = true
}
(
  <question ?>Orchestrator 从哪里派生 child 输出？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>Conversation Domain 是 single in-memory truth。</?>
    <decision-text ?>所有 delegate completion 分支 SHALL 从 Conversation Domain materialization 派生输出，compatibility mirror 只读且不拥有结果 authority。</?>
    <rationale ?>避免不同 driver 分支读取不同事实源并产生空结果。</?>
    <evidence ?>DelegateActor 注释与 driverRuntime 当前实现冲突。</?>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.harden-ai-workflow-agent-runtime.tool-call-identity {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  durable_candidate = true
}
(
  <question ?>并行 tool-call identity 缺失或冲突时是否允许猜测合并？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>不允许静默拼接工具名和参数。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Adapter 只能依据明确 provider contract 做 normalization；否则返回结构化 protocol failure。</?>
    <rationale ?>错误工具调用比显式失败更危险且难以恢复。</?>
    <evidence ?>事故中两组同名并行工具被重复拼接。</?>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.harden-ai-workflow-agent-runtime.stage-outcome {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  durable_candidate = true
}
(
  <question ?>怎样防止 workflow actor 在没有产物时持续探索十余分钟？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>按 KWF 的有限产品阶段，每轮必须有结构化进展，修复循环和 provider retry 都受产品 deadline 约束。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Every workflow actor turn SHALL produce a non-empty structured stage outcome or native tool effect; proof repair SHALL be bounded and the product stage deadline SHALL cap provider retries。</?>
    <rationale ?>provider timeout 不是用户旅程预算；只有可观测 transition 才能证明产品在前进。</?>
    <evidence ?>事故 session 十一分钟无 workspace mutation；KWF structured scaffold/infer and bounded model E2E。</?>
  )>
)>
